; Cloudflare Pages web records only. Preserve mail and all unrelated records.
; Add the custom domains in Pages before applying these CNAME records.
$ORIGIN suifleet.io.
$TTL 300
@ IN CNAME suifleet-marketing.pages.dev. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
www IN CNAME suifleet-marketing.pages.dev. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
app IN CNAME suifleet-console.pages.dev. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
docs IN CNAME suifleet-docs.pages.dev. ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
